;. /author_document_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition author_document
  ;= Author a Semidoc source proposal
    This flow returns native values. Use the retain_result writer for a standalone occurrence. Compose project_result when a Nenex document is wanted. Publish the named child flows before publishing this composition; their exact definitions are captured.

    ;@ /flow/input sources
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/input provider
    ;= provider

    ;@ /flow/step task ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/document_source
    ;@ /flow/bind pages document
    ;@ /flow/bind sources sources
    ;@ /flow/bind context sources
    ;= task

    ;@ /flow/step answered ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/interactive_requests
    ;@ /flow/bind tasks task
    ;@ /flow/bind provider provider
    ;= answered

    ;@ /flow/step proposal ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/stages/results
    ;@ /flow/bind responses answered
    ;= proposal

    ;@ /flow/result proposal
    ;= Author a Semidoc source proposal result

    ;@ /flow/page /
    ;= Author a Semidoc source proposal
      Read the explicit task and authoring contracts. Return name, source, definition and note. Source must be complete authored Semidoc using existing flow operations and explicit bindings. Repeated bindings remain separate. This stage does not create or publish a page. Missing receiver, requested procedure or authority must be clarified before effects.
